<https://w3id.org/aias#hasCommunication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a component to a communication it takes part in. States a bidirectional use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias#Function> .
