<https://w3id.org/aias#Actuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aktor"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner.\r\n\r\nThree specialisations concretise it, each taken from a subdomain pattern: the assignment and the flow of VDI 3682, and the communication of ISO/IEC 7498-1. Relations are classes rather than object properties so that a model can annotate one: an assignment is a thing, not an arrow."@en .
