<https://w3id.org/aias#hasFlow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Flow> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet eine Funktion oder eine Komponente mit der Zuordnung, die angibt, welche Ressource welche Funktion ausführt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/aias#" .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer Funktion, die es ausführt, aus welchem Teilbereich sie auch stammt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#EdgeDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Beschreibt strukturierte Beziehungen und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Funktionen und Komponenten."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ressource"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an AI system to a tie between its functions and its components."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasCommunication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Product> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A construct of this work, corresponding to the product of VDI 3682.\r\n\r\nProducts and resources share the component level and differ in their role: a resource performs functions, a product is transformed by them."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasInputCommunication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has input communication"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes physical system elements that perform functions or are transformed by them."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Function> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner et al., Systems Engineering, Springer 2019. The notion of a function is the general one of a purposeful transformation.\r\n\r\nWithout this class a process operator of VDI 3682 and an inference of ISO/IEC 22989 are unrelated things, and nothing can be said about both at once. Under one superclass they become comparable and are treated by the same mechanisms, above all the assignment to a component."@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Controller> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Devices for the deterministic and time-critical processing of signals in order to control the automated system or process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Marvin Schieseck" .
